  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis compositrice de parfums... Autrement dit,\nje suis ce que l’on appelle un « nez ».<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon rêve est d’un jour réussir à synthétiser un\nparfum à partir de l’odeur du Pokémon Fluvetin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Or, l’odeur dégagée par un Fluvetin\ndépend de son alimentation.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0072002C0020006C2019006F00640065007500720020006400E900670061006700E90065002000700061007200200075006E00200046006C00750076006500740069006E000A006400E900700065006E006400200064006500200073006F006E00200061006C0069006D0065006E0074006100740069006F006E002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour approfondir mes connaissances, j’aimerais\ndonner beaucoup de Baies à ce Fluvetin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour être exacte, j’aimerais lui donner 20 Baies\nCeriz, 5 Baies Tamato et 5 Baies Chocco.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flu ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C00750020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hélas, je fais face à un problème épineux...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E9006C00610073002C0020006A00650020006600610069007300200066006100630065002000E000200075006E002000700072006F0062006C00E8006D0065002000E900700069006E006500750078002E002E002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand je respire les odeurs de la ville, je n’arrive\nplus à préparer un parfum correctement !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai besoin d’aide ! Pourrais-tu aller chercher\nces Baies à ma place, s’il te plaît ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu peux trouver des Baies dans la ville,\nou sur les étals en plein air !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai besoin de 20 Baies Ceriz, 5 Baies Tamato\net 5 Baies Chocco.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100690020006200650073006F0069006E00200064006500200032003000200042006100690065007300200043006500720069007A002C00200035002000420061006900650073002000540061006D00610074006F000A0065007400200035002000420061006900650073002000430068006F00630063006F002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flulu ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C0075006C00750020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai besoin de 20 Baies Ceriz, 5 Baies Tamato\net 5 Baies Chocco.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100690020006200650073006F0069006E00200064006500200032003000200042006100690065007300200043006500720069007A002C00200035002000420061006900650073002000540061006D00610074006F000A0065007400200035002000420061006900650073002000430068006F00630063006F002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu m’as apporté 20 Baies Ceriz, 5 Baies Tamato\net 5 Baies Chocco ? Merci bien !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En mélangeant tous ces arômes, on devrait\nobtenir un parfum très complexe...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À propos, les Baies que je t’ai demandées\nont toutes une saveur épicée.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nCe nouveau parfum va donc être très relevé !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tintintin !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006E00740069006E00740069006E002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh bien ? Qu’est-ce qui t’arrive, Fluvetin ?\nJe ne t’ai jamais vu dans un tel état !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah ! Ça fait trop de Baies pour toi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006800200021002000C7006100200066006100690074002000740072006F007000200064006500200042006100690065007300200070006F0075007200200074006F00690020003F001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flufluuu.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C00750066006C007500750075002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais... tu avais pourtant l’air enthousiaste à l’idée\nde produire un tout nouveau parfum, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flulu !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C0075006C0075002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as raison... On va trouver un moyen de rendre\ntoutes ces Baies plus faciles à ingérer pour toi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Ça me rappelle le Nectar, cet excellent\nétablissement qui existait avant à Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si je trouvais un ancien employé du Nectar, il\nsaurait transformer ces Baies Ceriz en Jus Rubis,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nque Fluvetin pourrait facilement boire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fluflu !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C00750066006C0075002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci, grâce à tes efforts, j’ai élargi le champ\ndes possibles de la parfumerie !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEn remerciement, permets-moi de t’offrir\nces Aromates Modestes et ce Bonbon Exp.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 170
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fluflu !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C00750066006C0075002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci, grâce à tes efforts, j’ai élargi le champ\ndes possibles de la parfumerie !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’ai hâte d’en faire profiter à Romy, ma disciple !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
